{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And an inheritance shall not turn from one tribe to another, etc.</b> The reason He repeated the statement itself, saying just nearby ״וְלֹא תִסֹּב״ etc., is according to what I have written just nearby, that this is nothing but good counsel — so a second statement comes to establish an obligation upon all the children of Israel, to whom the command of ״וְכָל בַּת יוֹרֶשֶׁת״ etc., said just before this, is addressed."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:17:20.495319388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}